            "title": "Hair Care",
            "content": "<p>Our {hair_type} Hair can be washed and conditioned just like your natural hair. For the best results, we recommend using sulphate-free or organic hair care products to maintain the softness and longevity of the hair.</p><p>For best results, we recommend air drying your hair after washing. This helps retain moisture, reduces unnecessary heat exposure, and prolongs the life and quality of your hair.</p>"
