        "accordion_WQfGwf": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping and Returns",
            "content": "<p>Once your order has been placed, you have 24 hours to contact us if you wish to make any amendments. After this period, your order will be processed and no further changes can be made.</p><p>Each unit is custom made to order. Please allow 7-15 working days for your unit to be made before dispatch.</p><p>Once your order has been shipped, delivery typically takes:</p><ul><li>Royal Mail Tracked 24 (Tracked and Signed)</li><li>Royal Mail Special Delivery (Covers parcel if lost): Next working day before 1pm.</li></ul><p>For full details, please refer to our <a href=\"/pages/shipping-returns\">Shipping &amp; Returns Policy</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_cnzmCK": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "International Orders",
            "content": "<p>For orders shipped outside of the United Kingdom, import duties, taxes and customs fees may apply once your parcel reaches its destination country. These charges are determined by your local customs authorities and are the responsibility of the customer.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_Y9wNKB": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Disclaimer (Please Read)",
            "content": "<p><strong>Colour Disclaimer</strong></p><p>Every unit is unique. Slight variations in colour may occur. Please note that colours may appear differently depending on your device screen and lighting.</p><p><strong>Hair Length Disclaimer</strong></p><p>When selecting your desired hair length, please keep in mind that the final appearance will vary depending on how the hair is styled.</p><p>Curls may reduce the visible length by approximately 2-4 inches.</p><p>For example: If you would like your curled hair to appear approximately 22 inches long, we recommend selecting a straight hair length of 24-26 inches.</p><p>Please note that all hair lengths are measured when the hair is straight and fully stretched.</p><p><strong>Texture Disclaimer</strong></p><p>Please note that any unit displayed with a curled, loose wave or similar styled appearance has been heat styled. These looks are achieved by curling our straight hair and are intended to showcase the hair's versatility. This style is temporary and will gradually loosen over time, particularly after brushing or washing.</p><p>Once washed, the hair will return to its natural texture. The hair can be restyled using heat whenever desired.</p>"
